@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Our Story";
}

<section class="flat-spacing-1">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:840px">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
        <h1 class="fs-28 fw-6 mb-4">About ECommerce</h1>

        <p>We started with a simple idea: good, well-made pieces shouldn't be hard to find or
           complicated to buy. Every product in our catalog is chosen and listed by our small team,
           and every order — from checkout to delivery — is something we've built and tested
           ourselves, end to end.</p>

        <p>We're a young store. We don't have a hundred-year history to tell you about, but we do
           care about getting the basics right: clear product information, honest pricing, and a
           checkout that actually works the way it should.</p>

        <h5 class="mt-20 mb-14">Where we are</h5>
        <p>1234 Fashion Street, Suite 567, New York, NY 10001</p>

        <h5 class="mt-20 mb-14">Get in touch</h5>
        <p>Have a question about an order, a product, or anything else? Visit our
           <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">contact page</a> — we read every message.</p>
    </div>
</section>
